  "summary": "Malicious code in onlyspins-casino (npm)",
  "details": "Onlyspins-casino@1.0.0 is a casino-promotion spam package. It ships no functional code (index.js is an empty module) and no install scripts; its only content is a French-language README that promotes the online casino site onlyspinss[.]fr with affiliate-style review copy. The package is published as part of a bulk casino-spam campaign and provides no legitimate library functionality.",
